et_id":"huntik:page:7573","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:SAS-148","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7573"}]},{"name":"new characters","value_wikitext":"[[Enderby]] (card)<br>[[Morgan the Knife]] (card)","value_text":"Enderby (card)\nMorgan the Knife (card)","links":[{"target_title":"Enderby","label":"Enderby","target_id":"huntik:page:11838","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Enderby","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A11838"},{"target_title":"Morgan the Knife","label":"Morgan the Knife","target_id":"huntik:page:11033","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Morgan_the_Knife","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A11033"}]},{"name":"new titans","value_wikitext":"[[Metzi]] (card)","value_text":"Metzi (card)","links":[{"target_title":"Metzi","label":"Metzi","target_id":"huntik:page:14444","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Metzi","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A14444"}]}],"start":0,"end":428}],"sections":[{"heading":"Synopsis","level":2,"wikitext":"To teach the new [[Seekers]] how to play the TCG, [[Dante Vale]] plays against [[Lok Lambert]] as [[Cherit]] mediates. Their mission - to [[TCG:SAS-148|retrieve the Ring of Arc]]. The trio discuss the rules and exchange tactics as they battle it out on the Mission Map to complete their mission.","text":"To teach the new Seekers how to play the TCG, Dante Vale plays against Lok Lambert as Cherit mediates. Their mission - to retrieve the Ring of Arc. The trio discuss the rules and exchange tactics as they battle it out on the Mission Map to complete their mission."},{"heading":"Trivia","level":2,"wikitext":"*Lok has a flashback to finding the [[Ring of Arc]] in \"[[Crawling the Catacombs]]\".\n*The tutorial was also released internationally on Upper Deck's International YouTube channel on 24th February 2009.","text":"*Lok has a flashback to finding the Ring of Arc in \"Crawling the Catacombs\".\n*The tutorial was also released internationally on Upper Deck's International YouTube channel on 24th February 2009."},{"heading":"Cast","level":2,"wikitext":"*[[Yuri Lowenthal]] as [[Lok Lambert]]\n*[[Marc Thompson]] as [[Dante Vale]], [[Cherit]]\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"*Yuri Lowenthal as Lok Lambert\n*Marc Thompson as Dante Vale, Cherit"},{"heading":"Full Episode","level":2,"wikitext":"{{FullEpisodeVideo\n|link = v=s0R_CfGFhoM&ab_}}\n[[Category:TCG]]\n[[Category:Secrets and Seekers]]\n[[Category:Minisodes]]\n[[Category:Starter Deck]]","text":""}],"full_text":"The Huntik TCG Tutorial is an exclusive minisode of Huntik: Secrets & Seekers that serves as a step by step video guide on how to play the Huntik Trading Card Game. It was released by Upper Deck on the bonus DVD in the Starter Deck.\n\n==Synopsis==\nTo teach the new Seekers how to play the TCG, Dante Vale plays against Lok Lambert as Cherit mediates. Their mission - to retrieve the Ring of Arc. The trio discuss the rules and exchange tactics as they battle it out on the Mission Map to complete their mission. \n\n== Trivia ==\n*Lok has a flashback to finding the Ring of Arc in \"Crawling the Catacombs\".\n*The tutorial was also released internationally on Upper Deck's International YouTube channel on 24th February 2009. \n\n== Cast ==\n*Yuri Lowenthal as Lok Lambert\n*Marc Thompson as Dante Vale, Cherit\n\n== Full Episode ==","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox episode|image = File:TCG Tutorial Dante Lok Cherit.png|link=v=s0R_CfGFhoM&ab_|exclusive = DVD Minisode|released={{Country|UK}} February 17, 2009<br>{{Country|US}} February 17, 2009<br>{{Country|IT}} February 24, 2009|director=[[Upper Deck]]|locations=[[Prague Huntik Hotel]]|mission=[[TCG:SAS-148|Retrieve the Ring of Arc]]|new characters=[[Enderby]] (card)<br>[[Morgan the Knife]] (card)|new titans=[[Metzi]] (card)}}\nThe '''Huntik TCG Tutorial''' is an exclusive minisode of ''[[Huntik: Secrets & Seekers]]'' that serves as a step by step video guide on how to play the ''[[Huntik Trading Card Game]]''.  It was released by [[Upper Deck]] on the bonus DVD in the [[TCG:Starter Deck|Starter Deck]].\n\n==Synopsis==\nTo teach the new [[Seekers]] how to play the TCG, [[Dante Vale]] plays against [[Lok Lambert]] as [[Cherit]] mediates. Their mission - to [[TCG:SAS-148|retrieve the Ring of Arc]]. The trio discuss the rules and exchange tactics as they battle it out on the Mission Map to complete their mission. \n\n== Trivia ==\n*Lok has a flashback to finding the [[Ring of Arc]] in \"[[Crawling the Catacombs]]\".\n*The tutorial was also released internationally on Upper Deck's International YouTube channel on 24th February 2009. \n\n== Cast ==\n*[[Yuri Lowenthal]] as [[Lok Lambert]]\n*[[Marc Thompson]] as [[Dante Vale]], [[Cherit]]\n\n{{Clear}}\n== Full Episode ==\n{{FullEpisodeVideo\n|link = v=s0R_CfGFhoM&ab_}}\n[[Category:TCG]]\n[[Category:Secrets and Seekers]]\n[[Category:Minisodes]]\n[[Category:Starter Deck]]","categories":["Minisodes","Secrets and Seekers","Starter Deck","TCG"],"links":[{"target_title":"Upper Deck","label":"Upper Deck","target_id":"huntik:page:21958","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Upper_Deck","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A21958"},{"target_title":"Prague Huntik Hotel","label":"Prague Huntik Hotel","target_id":"huntik:page:2744","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Prague_Huntik_Hotel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2744"},{"target_title":"TCG:SAS-148","label":"Retrieve the Ring of Arc","target_id":"huntik:page:7573","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:SAS-148","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7573"},{"target_title":"Enderby","label":"Enderby","target_id":"huntik:page:11838","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Enderby","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A11838"},{"target_title":"Morgan the Knife","label":"Morgan the Knife","target_id":"huntik:page:11033","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Morgan_the_Knife","st